1. Introduction

1.1 Purpose

The purpose of this Software Test Plan (STP) is to define the testing approach, objectives, test environment, and test cases for the EduBot AI application.
The document ensures that every feature of the system is tested to verify correct functionality, performance, reliability, and usability.

1.2 Scope
This testing covers all major modules of EduBot AI, including:

.PDF Upload
.OCR Processing
.RAG Retrieval
.Gemini AI Response
.Chat History
.Language Selection
.PDF Summary
.Source References
.User Interface

2. Test Objectives

The main objectives are:
.Verify all features work correctly.
.Ensure accurate AI-generated responses.
.Validate document retrieval.
.Test user interface functionality.
.Identify bugs before deployment.
.Ensure application stability.

3. Test Environment
| Component        | Details                 |
| ---------------- | ----------------------- |
| Operating System | Windows 11 / macOS      |
| Language         | Python 3.11+            |
| Frontend         | Streamlit               |
| AI Model         | Google Gemini 2.5 Flash |
| Vector Database  | FAISS                   |
| Browser          | Google Chrome           |
| IDE              | VS Code                 |

4. Test Strategy

The following testing methods were used:
.Functional Testing
.User Interface Testing
.Integration Testing
.Performance Testing
.Regression Testing
.Manual Testing

5. Test Cases

Test Case 1 – Upload PDF
| Field           | Value                           |
| --------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Test ID         | TC-01                           |
| Module          | PDF Upload                      |
| Objective       | Verify PDF upload functionality |
| Input           | Valid PDF                       |
| Expected Result | PDF uploaded successfully       |
| Actual Result   | PDF uploaded successfully       |
| Status          | Pass                            |

