8. Conclusion

Testing confirmed that EduBot AI performs as expected across its major features, including document upload, OCR, RAG retrieval, AI-based question answering, chat management, and language selection. 
The application provides stable performance, an intuitive interface, and reliable responses based on uploaded educational documents.
Based on the conducted tests, the system is suitable for academic demonstrations and internship submission.